  "slug": "double-tofu-veggie-breakfast-skillet",
  "name": "Double tofu and vegetable breakfast skillet",
  "description": "Twice the usual tofu in one skillet with kidney beans, cauliflower, zucchini and tomato, seasoned with garlic and chili powder — a very large breakfast that reaches a high calorie target on plants alone.",
  "iconKey": "pot",
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet and cook the garlic, the small cauliflower florets and the sliced zucchini over medium-high heat for 4 minutes.",
    "Cut the tofu into cubes, add it with the chili powder and the salt, and cook for 5 minutes, turning twice, until the edges catch.",
    "Stir in the drained kidney beans and the chopped tomato and cook for 1 minute to heat through.",
    "Serve the skillet as it is, in one large portion."
